            "Aria_Chart": "Histogram of {0}",
            "Note_FreqSum": "Frequency is set to Sum of \"{0}\", which weights each value by its size. Counts were corrected automatically. To remove this note, set Frequency to Count.",
            "Note_FreqZeros": "{0} rows with the value 0 can't be counted while Frequency is a Sum, so they are left out.",
            "Note_FreqDecimals": "Frequency has decimals, so it may not be a count. For exact counts, set Frequency to Count of \"{0}\".",
            "Stat_Pp": "Pp",
            "Stat_Ppk": "Ppk",
            "Stat_ExpectedOut": "Expected out (normal)",
            "Stat_Pp_Tip": "Overall process performance: (USL \u2212 LSL) \u00f7 (6 \u00d7 overall std dev). Cp and Cpk need time-ordered data, so a histogram shows Pp and Ppk.",
            "Stat_Ppk_Tip": "Overall performance against the nearer limit: distance from mean to that limit \u00f7 (3 \u00d7 overall std dev).",
            "Stat_ExpectedOut_Tip": "Share outside the spec limits if the data followed a normal curve with this mean and std dev. Compare with the observed Out of spec.",
            "Role_Split": "Split by (Histogram Pro)",
            "Role_Split_Description": "One histogram per group, e.g. per line or shift, with the same bins. Needs a Histogram Pro licence; without one, all data is shown combined.",
